  "description": "Click here and download the STL 3D Printing Merry Christmas Sign STL · Window, Mac, Linux · Last updated 2026 · Commercial licence included ✓",
  "fullDescription": "Add a stylish festive statement to your holiday décor with this Merry Christmas Sign STL. The design combines an elegant flowing “Merry” script with bold “CHRISTMAS” lettering featuring detailed vertical ribbed accents. A charming Christmas tree and star complete the composition, creating a modern yet timeless seasonal decoration designed to stand beautifully as a decorative display.\n\nPerfect for Christmas décor, mantel displays, tabletop arrangements, shelf styling, holiday centerpieces, entryway decorations, festive gifts, and seasonal 3D printing projects. The combination of script typography, dimensional lettering, and Christmas motifs makes this sign an eye-catching addition to modern, Scandinavian, farmhouse, and minimalist holiday interiors.\n\nProduct Highlights:\n\nDecorative Merry Christmas typography\nElegant flowing script lettering\nBold dimensional Christmas text\nDetailed vertical ribbed accents\nChristmas tree decorative element\nBeautiful star topper detail\nFreestanding display-style design\nModern festive aesthetic\nSTL file format\nDesigned for 3D printing\nPerfect for tabletop, mantel, and shelf décor\nDigital product — no physical item included\n\nColor Customization:\nThe model can be colored using software such as Bambu Studio, PrusaSlicer, Cura, or other compatible slicer software, allowing you to customize the lettering, Christmas tree, star, ribbed details, and other elements with your preferred colors.\n\nNote: This is a digital STL file, not a physical product. A compatible 3D printer is required to create the physical model.",
